+All 1,935 tracking attempts of the stratified sample (Sec.~\ref{sec:prospective}) were valid,
+and the production-level reruns reproduced the archived values. Refinement changed four of the
+387 production-profile classifications, three at the medium levels and a fourth at the fine
+levels, all from infeasible to feasible (Table~\ref{tab:retracking}). All four are
+constraint-aware evaluations whose largest violation was a bunch length at most
